covers the Orcraft software: the orcraft package with the controller,
the endpoint application and the test framework, the Orcraft maze
example application binaries, and every update to them (together "the
Software"). By installing or running the Software you accept this
agreement. If you use the Software on behalf of a company, you accept it
for that company and confirm that you may do so.

The Orcraft Terms of Use at https://orcraft.app/legal/terms/ govern
accounts, subscriptions, and related online services. The Privacy Policy
at https://orcraft.app/legal/privacy/ describes how personal information
is processed. Where the Terms of Use and this Agreement conflict
concerning the licensing, installation, or use of the Software, this
Agreement shall prevail, unless otherwise expressly agreed in writing.
The Privacy Policy is provided as a separate transparency notice and
does not independently amend the contractual rights and obligations
under this Agreement.

